HQBD LICENSE

This package contains content under multiple license scopes.

## HQBD v0.0.1 content

HQBD v0.0.1 is derived from CVDP v1.1.0 and repackages it under HQBD file, directory, and case ID naming for dataset organization. The CVDP content and third-party-derived content included in `hqbd_v0.0.1/` are not relicensed as HQBD original content.

The JSONL case IDs have been renamed from `cvdp_*` to `hqbd_*`. The mapping from HQBD IDs to original CVDP IDs is provided in `hqbd_v0.0.1/ID_MAPPING.csv`.

## CVDP v1.1.0 source and licenses

Source dataset:

Comprehensive Verilog Design Problems (CVDP) Benchmark Dataset
https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/cvdp-benchmark-dataset

For preserved CVDP licensing information, see:

- `hqbd_v0.0.1/LICENSE`
- `hqbd_v0.0.1/NOTICE`

The preserved CVDP license states that dataset non-code is under CC BY 4.0, dataset code is under Apache License 2.0, and third-party code-derived datapoints or public Git context bundles may be governed by additional or different upstream license terms listed in NOTICE.

## HQBD original content

The final license for future HQBD-original benchmark cases, documentation, and release metadata has not yet been selected. Until a final license is chosen, treat HQBD-original draft content as project-internal material unless a release explicitly states otherwise.

Do not assume that all files in this package share a single license unless a future release explicitly states that.
